			"If you are holding this book, you have already walked through the Garden, which means you have already seen the light at its centre, which means it has already seen you. Don't worry. It does that to everyone.",
			"I didn't write most of what follows. I found it. Some of it was in filing cabinets that had rusted shut, some of it was on tapes that only played once before the reels gave out, and some of it was printed, line after patient line, by a machine that had been alone in the dark for a very long time.",
