		kind = "letter",
		meta = "Found tucked inside the back cover of the Archive. Undated. Signed I.V.",
		blocks = {
			"If you are reading this, someone has put my pages back in order. Thank you. I could never manage it myself; they kept moving.",
			"There are things I know and things I believe, and I've been careful my whole life to keep them in separate drawers. Here is the last thing I know: the Lantern is not dangerous. It never was. It only ever turned up what was already there.",
			"Here is what I believe. I believe it came here on purpose. I believe it has been patient with us in a way we have never been patient with anything. And I believe the subject in Chamber 5 was not the first visitor to ask, every morning, whether today was the day.",
